# wip685: FUNC + SELECT = the pattern bank (1-16 / 17-32); on the ARP page the header chip says PATTERN BANK n
wait 300
tap ARP
expect arp 1
shot pbank_arp_1.png
key b10 down
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect pbank 1
shot pbank_arp_2.png
turn SELECT -1
wait 100
expect pbank 0
key b10 up
shot pbank_arp_back.png
# wip686: in bank 2 the top chip is RED (ARP page chip, SEQ page TRACK chip)
key b10 down
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
key b10 up
wait 2000
shot pbank_arp_red.png
tap SEQ
wait 200
shot pbank_seq_red.png
